[{"id":"smq-year1-1.51-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>The diagram below shows bivariate data.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.51/questions/assets/diagrams/q1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Which of the following best describes the data shown in the diagram?</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p>Positive correlation</p></td><td><p>Negative correlation</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Positive nonlinear</p></td><td><p>Negative nonlinear</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>association</p></td><td><p>association</p></td></tr></table></div>","steps":["<p>Positive nonlinear association</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.51-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>The diagram below shows bivariate data.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.51/questions/assets/diagrams/q2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Which of the following best describes the data shown in the diagram?</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p>Positive correlation</p></td><td><p>Negative correlation</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Positive nonlinear</p></td><td><p>Negative nonlinear</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>association</p></td><td><p>association</p></td></tr></table></div>","steps":["<p>Positive nonlinear association</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.51-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Barnaby collects the bivariate data shown in the table below.</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0.8</p></td><td><p>1.2</p></td><td><p>2.6</p></td><td><p>2.9</p></td><td><p>1.9</p></td><td><p>1.6</p></td><td><p>2.5</p></td><td><p>2.1</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>2.5</p></td><td><p>1.9</p></td><td><p>5.8</p></td><td><p>8.4</p></td><td><p>4.3</p></td><td><p>0.9</p></td><td><p>5.9</p></td><td><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>He ranks the data from smallest to largest and correctly finds the differences, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and the squares of the differences, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as shown in the table below.</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p>Rank <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Rank <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sum d_i^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the sum of the squares of the differences, and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the number of pairs of bivariate data in the original table, calculate Spearman's Rank correlation coefficient using the formula</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r_s=1-\\frac{6\\sum d_i^2}{n(n^2-1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>Which of the following best describes the association found in a)?</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p>Strong Positive</p></td><td><p>Moderate Positive</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Weak Positive</p></td><td><p>Weak Negative</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Moderate Negative</p></td><td><p>Strong Negative</p></td></tr></table></div></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum d_i^2=4+0+1+0+1+4+1+1=12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"n=8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r_s=1-\\frac{6\\times12}{8(8^2-1)}=\\frac67=0.857\\text{ (3 SF)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Strong Positive</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.51-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Calculate Spearman's Rank correlation coefficient for the following bivariate data:</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>4.3</p></td><td><p>3.8</p></td><td><p>8.6</p></td><td><p>8.0</p></td><td><p>1.1</p></td><td><p>5.5</p></td><td><p>4.8</p></td><td><p>6.5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>7.9</p></td><td><p>8.1</p></td><td><p>7.3</p></td><td><p>7.2</p></td><td><p>9.3</p></td><td><p>7.7</p></td><td><p>7.8</p></td><td><p>7.6</p></td></tr></table></div>","steps":["<div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>4.3</p></td><td><p>3.8</p></td><td><p>8.6</p></td><td><p>8.0</p></td><td><p>1.1</p></td><td><p>5.5</p></td><td><p>4.8</p></td><td><p>6.5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>7.9</p></td><td><p>8.1</p></td><td><p>7.3</p></td><td><p>7.2</p></td><td><p>9.3</p></td><td><p>7.7</p></td><td><p>7.8</p></td><td><p>7.6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Rank <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Rank <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>9</p></td><td><p>25</p></td><td><p>36</p></td><td><p>36</p></td><td><p>49</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>9</p></td></tr></table></div>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum d_i^2=9+25+36+36+49+1+1+9=166\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"n=8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r_s=1-\\frac{6\\times166}{8(8^2-1)}=-\\frac{41}{42}=-0.976\\text{ (3 SF)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.51-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Uzair wants to investigate whether there is an association between the number of hours students study, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and their scores on a maths test, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The data collected from a random sample of 8 students is shown in the table below.</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p>Student</p></td><td><p>A</p></td><td><p>B</p></td><td><p>C</p></td><td><p>D</p></td><td><p>E</p></td><td><p>F</p></td><td><p>G</p></td><td><p>H</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>49</p></td><td><p>58</p></td><td><p>62</p></td><td><p>60</p></td><td><p>59</p></td><td><p>71</p></td><td><p>46</p></td><td><p>66</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Calculate Spearman's Rank correlation coefficient for the data.</p>","steps":["<div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td><p>Student</p></td><td><p>A</p></td><td><p>B</p></td><td><p>C</p></td><td><p>D</p></td><td><p>E</p></td><td><p>F</p></td><td><p>G</p></td><td><p>H</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>49</p></td><td><p>58</p></td><td><p>62</p></td><td><p>60</p></td><td><p>59</p></td><td><p>71</p></td><td><p>46</p></td><td><p>66</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Rank <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>2.5</p></td><td><p>4.5</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4.5</p></td><td><p>2.5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Rank <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0.5</p></td><td><p>1.5</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>3.5</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-4.5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac94\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>9</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{49}{4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{81}{4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td></tr></table></div>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum d_i^2=\\frac14+\\frac94+0+4+9+0+\\frac{49}{4}+\\frac{81}{4}=48\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"n=8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r_s=1-\\frac{6\\times48}{8(8^2-1)}=\\frac37=0.429\\text{ (3 SF)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]